<title>USA: Tracor Inc wins $50 mln defense contract.</title>
<headline>Tracor Inc wins $50 mln defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitro Corp, a subsidiary of Tracor Inc, said on Thursday it was awarded a five-year contract from UNISYS Federal Systems Division of McLean, Va., to support the Defense Information Systems Agency DEIS II program.</p>
<p>A statement from Tracor said the program will provide integrated services for the U.S. Dept. of Defense.</p>
<p>Contracts were awarded to six vendors and the potential value to Vitro is $50 million, Tracor said.</p>
</text>
